ind":"announcement","title":"Exchange Alley Devlog 1: Free book inside - Everyman his own broker","summary":"Exchange Alley Devlog 1: Free book inside - Everyman his own brokerOne of my favourite parts of game development is diving into the research prior to fleshing out the mechanics of a game, learning the real history and turning it into an interactive experience. So, when I discovered that a book titled Every Man His Own Broker; or A Guide to Exchange Alley had been published about the very core of my game Exchange Alley, well, what better material could exist?Every Man His Own Broker; or A Guide t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T21:14:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352579","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4950300-1837955055366635","game_id":"steam-4950300","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Exchange Alley","summary":"Step into the bustling early stock market of the coffee-houses of 18th Century London, where fortunes can be won or lost in seconds over nothing more than rumours.Experience the birth of the modern stock market, where politicians, gentlemen, opportunists and scoundrels collided to buy and sell shares in the British Empire's newest financial ventures. Witness the first financial bubbles and make a killing on an overheard rumour before the papers get to it, or spread your own to gain an edge over ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T16:31:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055366635","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4950300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-